 "text": "Hi, how's everything with you? For some people, yes. If you' planning a big wedding with lots of guests or an overseas destination, a planner can save you a lot of time and stress. Then a planner can take care of the dates and venue while you focus on the guest list and flowers. It usually means the whole day, so if you booked the venue for the whole day, you' need to add on extra. It can be, especially if you start early in the day. Some families fight about it. Talk to her now and find way to make it work. Maybe ask her about it. Would she rather plan it herself, or have someone else take care of it?",
